      "The eligibility and consumer demand-letter rules are stated; the rule adds the 30-day presumption of receipt for consumer claims, four-month dismissal, one-hour default, vacatur of a default under CPLR 5015, transfer when all appear by attorney, and binding arbitration. Its 'principal office in the City of New York' is superseded by CCA 1801-A(a) ('state of New York').",
